# Code owners (docs/architecture-guardrails.md). A pull request that touches a path below requests review from its
# owner; with "Require review from Code Owners" on in the branch ruleset, it cannot merge without that approval.
# Later lines win over earlier ones for the same path.

# Dependencies and build configuration: package versions, project references, NuGet sources, MSBuild defaults.
*.csproj                                   @jeffreypalermo
*.props                                    @jeffreypalermo
*.targets                                  @jeffreypalermo
Directory.Packages.props                   @jeffreypalermo
Directory.Build.props                      @jeffreypalermo
Directory.Build.targets                    @jeffreypalermo
NuGet.Config                               @jeffreypalermo
nuget.config                               @jeffreypalermo
NuGet.config                               @jeffreypalermo
global.json                                @jeffreypalermo

# The architecture guardrails themselves: weakening a gate needs the same review as the change it would let through.
.editorconfig                              @jeffreypalermo
/src/Core/BannedSymbols.txt                @jeffreypalermo
/src/UnitTests/Architecture/               @jeffreypalermo
/scripts/nuget/                            @jeffreypalermo
/.github/workflows/nuget-package-gate.yml  @jeffreypalermo
/.github/CODEOWNERS                        @jeffreypalermo
/docs/architecture-guardrails.md           @jeffreypalermo
